{
  "project_id": "prj-e7c564f6-084e-4f93-8a9d-c4ddeb09b3fa",
  "draft_id": "draft-d07734c7-a6d0-453a-9604-2717fc2bc19d",
  "draft_revision": 2,
  "draft_body": "林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，林默沿着长廊向前走，最后把银钥匙交给陈澈并得知弟弟还活着。",
  "draft_body_sha256": "c37ec0f518fbf7e7c499cb4dc0e23db72f8edeb458dc8939618e7ce8bbecadee",
  "source_revision": 1,
  "memory_version": 4,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-17e29a0e-b172-43d4-a01f-0f261c5bc4f6",
      "chapter_number": 1,
      "chapter_title": "雾钟",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-e4dd3646-cb7e-4f5f-b2f6-bdd7a09b604c",
      "span_body": "灰港的雾钟只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次，别的潮声不会让它响。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "94ba09a3cf9e29cb6a363a03322de398f60a9af31d2a89b50a916f392ec5e12e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-01f6f3a0-b975-420d-9ac1-8327e80d18d0",
      "chapter_number": 2,
      "chapter_title": "裂纹罗盘",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-ea1e68b5-ca5d-4947-8454-8fce972d30f0",
      "span_body": "黄铜罗盘的镜面有一道月牙裂纹，此刻由苏岑放在外套内袋。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "68dacbc00263341e60fdeb68f264492dc0953140827d264994dcd12e9a26b422"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-9950f5eb-09a3-4274-b626-75d9f850a4ad",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "chapter_title": "迟到的渡船",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-bb307c59-743c-49ff-87c6-fe3a4483935b",
      "span_body": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "bfc55c345ab2ca0d5d343ea3733b01bf801a9aac8b040685f711076b08bd8b03"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-7886b7a5-e127-451c-8fbd-f1be99005f55",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "chapter_title": "无字潮表",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-f5e47549-30ca-414b-9a42-776a9757fb5f",
      "span_body": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "2b42960d67fb622a2484050f9afe31dea302dd059c7dda3cf0d31eab4a70bbd3"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-3faba7f1-312c-42be-8c35-65f270ddbe19",
      "chapter_number": 5,
      "chapter_title": "盐雾信箱",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-5fc7ea8a-a12b-4232-9977-7e25a10ab0f6",
      "span_body": "纸条只写着‘白色渡船没有靠岸’，署名和日期都被盐雾抹去了。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8a0f8a53b219be663bc27b02decd36f0f5600f1e703c9b71f82dae2b4b3f1387"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-a197e8c5-d900-4519-8504-3c6f47ae809b",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "chapter_title": "低室电台",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-5f782d81-63c7-4904-bce1-026253b90960",
      "span_body": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "8cfce58f0ce8de9ee07de1a3123b29e091c5b1917928caf4f6a90dfc79f04c3e"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-8fb8034b-5bd5-4154-840e-56103f91e559",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "chapter_title": "潮线之外",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-da88a258-f4fc-49d4-bd98-d9d25f7b56c0",
      "span_body": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "82d77670ec3f945f5da30dd608e7accd6640a3f09bf103c54114bcf52141e1ff"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-c5b49013-11ea-4650-ba69-2b5075dd461b",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "chapter_title": "北堤灯火",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-d0b44be5-7b26-4704-9626-bf1892dd5e20",
      "span_body": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "ab75da7e0d3ec24955927e77a13bcf72efac68cf8d8d7d84922e5f0cbfb6dbcd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-878a54f8-dc1b-4485-b736-a564532ac518",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "chapter_title": "换手",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-ff2a13a5-2d43-4df9-a8f3-e09064aacdfe",
      "span_body": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b07ea48fcdc8ed1f76041a0cd9188055ec40adeef4a969b63b212357bef229dd"
    },
    {
      "chapter_id": "ch-84329ae1-5603-4a4c-9fe9-95577ee0cf5f",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "chapter_title": "回声坐标",
      "chapter_body": "",
      "chapter_revision": 1,
      "span_id": "span-4ddda99d-90c6-47b6-a3f7-5e5d3965d20a",
      "span_body": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "span_revision": 1,
      "chapter_body_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
      "span_body_sha256": "b3265433a0a1022e4d049a4768879f6763f8db0dbca1c858802e228639ea3e6c"
    }
  ],
